464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 155 0 R
/E (In our sample, 38% of inspired respondents attributed their inspiration moment to Instagram. The closest channel, YouTube, commanded roughly half that share \(about 55%\). This sample finding is broadly directionally consistent with category observations from Meta's India platform reports \(where travel-content engagement growth has consistently led the platform\) and from independent India social-listening studies \(Buzzoka 2025; Statista India Social Index\). Two structural reasons make the share plausible: the medium's visual-first format rewards travel imagery, and the Reels format is well-suited to the "this place exists and you can go" discovery moment. The finding should be read as a sample observation in this study; replication in larger or differently recruited panels would tighten the estimate. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
