662 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The fastest-growing outbound cohort in India, and a disproportionate contributor to the post-COVID outbound recovery of Singapore, Hong Kong, and Thailand \(on consideration data, not arrivals\). Decision window of 38 days. Instagram is the dominant inspiration channel; long-form YouTube is the secondary verification step. Key trigger: solo-female-advocacy creators in the 200K to 1M follower range. Avoids destinations with perceived safety concerns even when objectively safe; social proof from other women is the unlock.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
