666 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The largest cohort by volume, at 27% of the panel. Inspired heavily by ShareChat and WhatsApp-shared content from peer family travellers, not by creators with large metro followings. Decision window of 63 days, but the booking executes within 12 hours of the decision, typically through tour operators. Vegetarian and halal-friendly inventory is a structural filter: destinations without clear messaging on this lose the cohort at the pre-consideration stage.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
