/P 172 0 R
/E (The 64-question instrument was developed iteratively across three pilot waves between October 2025 and January 2026. Modules: \(a\) demographic and outbound-eligibility verification \(8 questions\), \(b\) recent international travel history \(12\), \(c\) inspiration-to-booking retrace for the most recent trip \(18\), \(d\) channel attribution and recall \(14\), \(e\) creator and content recall, including specific creator and content-name recall \(8\), and \(f\) forward intent and consideration set \(4\). The instrument was pre-tested with cognitive interviews \(N = 24\) before pilot deployment.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [3]
>>
